  "governing_obligation": "Migration status shall be a strictly observational operation that reports absence without initializing anything, inspects existing targets only through demonstrably non-mutating access, never migrates, repairs, checkpoints, vacuums, changes database configuration, writes schema or ledger state, or replaces invalid content, prefers the authenticated running-instance status path over unsafe offline interference, truthfully distinguishes current, pending, drifted, future, invalid, integrity-failed, live/locked-limited, and inspection-failed states, and must prove through filesystem-snapshot acceptance tests that the status operation itself produces no side effects.",
